= Social Democracy: The Spanish Republic

This is a total conversion of *Social Democracy: An Alternate History*, re-setting the game in the Second Spanish Republic (1931–1936). You play the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> - the Spanish Socialist Workers' Party - guiding the young Republic from its proclamation in April 1931 to the military coup of July 1936 that begins the Civil War.

